## Tibero proprietary assets — TmaxSoft license restricts redistribution.
##   - tibero7-jdbc-*.jar : TmaxSoft JDBC driver (not on Maven Central)
##   - license.xml        : 30-day trial license, hostname-bound
## Both are dev-private. Internal devs place these locally per
## tests/e2e/tibero/README.md; the Tibero Maven profile auto-activates
## when the jar is present, and Tibero @Test methods auto-skip via
## @EnabledIf("...TiberoEnvironment#isAvailable") when either is missing.
tests/e2e/lib/tibero7-jdbc-*.jar
tests/e2e/tibero/license.xml

